# Vulnerabilities in the container image that we have looked at and accepted for now, one per line.
# Read by the image job in .github/workflows/ci.yml (Trivy). Only CRITICAL, fixable findings fail the
# build, so this file should usually be empty.
#
# Each entry is a decision, not a silence. Write it as
#
#   CVE-2026-0000 exp:2026-12-31
#
# with a comment above it saying why it does not apply here or what the plan is. Trivy stops honouring
# an entry on its `exp:` date, so the finding fails the build again and has to be looked at.
#
# (Intentionally empty at the time of writing: nothing has been scanned yet. The first CI run on
# main is the first scan, and whatever it finds is decided here.)
